# Xcode-related
**/dgph
**/xcuserdata/

# The Swift package lockfile is generated by Xcode and is never committed.
# A lockfile which was written for an older dependency set makes Xcode
# fetch packages the current graph does not use and then abort the build
# with an internal error while it registers the fetched packages:
#
#   *** -[NSMutableArray insertObjects:atIndexes:]: count of array (31)
#       differs from count of index set (28)
#
# Flutter pins the plugin versions in `pubspec.lock`, so the Swift lockfile
# only duplicated that information and went stale on every dependency
# upgrade. Xcode resolves the packages fresh instead.
**/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved
